## Custom 404

- Branded not-found page at `src/app/not-found.tsx` with violet accent and home/Kundli CTAs

## Homepage ItemList JSON-LD

`src/app/page.tsx` renders an **ItemList** JSON-LD listing all tools from VEDIC_FEATURES, MATRIX_FEATURES, and MORE_TOOLS. When adding new tools, ensure they appear in one of these arrays so they are included in the ItemList.

## Checklist for new Vedic tool pages

1. Add `VEDIC_SEO` entry in `src/app/vedic/seo.ts` (title, description, keywords, seoIntro, faqs, relatedTools)
2. Create `layout.tsx` with `buildVedicMetadata()`, BreadcrumbJsonLd, FAQJsonLd
3. Create `page.tsx` as client component with SeoIntro + RelatedTools
4. Add route to sitemap in `src/app/sitemap.ts`
5. Add to `/tools` directory and navigation
6. Add i18n keys in `en.ts` and `hi.ts` at minimum
7. Add cross-links in related pages' `relatedTools`
8. Add footer link in `SiteFooter.tsx`
9. Ensure the tool appears in VEDIC_FEATURES, MATRIX_FEATURES, or MORE_TOOLS for ItemList JSON-LD
